00:37:48,875 --> 00:37:53,181
So, let us denote this optimal time as tau opt and the path as p opt.

255
00:37:55,085 --> 00:38:04,054
So, then we get tau opt P opt as output of this solved TSP, the TSP solver, where the input is this modified graph.

256
00:38:07,677 --> 00:38:18,467
Now, we cannot stop there, as I have already mentioned, because what we get at the end need not be the original graph due to the hypothetical edges.

